{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_189_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_189","textTraditional":"一、八年，春，陳侯之弟招殺陳世子偃師。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_189_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_189","textTraditional":"鄉曰陳公子招，今曰陳侯之弟招何也？曰，盡其親，所以惡招也。兩下相殺不志乎春秋，此其志何也？世子云者，唯君之貳也。云可以重之存焉志之也。諸侯之尊，弟兄不得以屬通。其弟云者，親之也。親而殺之，惡也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_189_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_189","textTraditional":"二、夏，四月，辛丑，陳侯溺卒。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_189_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_189","textTraditional":"三、叔弓如晉。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_189_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_189","textTraditional":"四、楚人執陳行人干徵師，殺之。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_189_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_189","textTraditional":"稱人以執大夫，執有罪也。稱行人，怨接於上也。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_189_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_189","textTraditional":"五、陳公子留出奔鄭。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_189_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_189","textTraditional":"六、秋，蒐於紅。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_189_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_189","textTraditional":"正也。因蒐狩以習用武事，禮之大者也。艾蘭以為防，置旃以為轅門，以葛覆質以為槷，流旁握，御轚者不得入。車軌塵，馬餱蹄，揜禽旅，御者不失其馳，然後射者能中。過防弗逐，不從奔之道也。面傷不獻，不成禽不獻。禽雖多，天子取三十焉，其餘與士眾，以習射於射宮。射而中，田不得禽，則得禽。田得禽而射不中，則不得禽。是以知古之貴仁義而賤勇力也。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_189_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_189","textTraditional":"七、陳人殺其大夫公子過。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_189_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_189","textTraditional":"八、大雩。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_clt_189_12","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_189","textTraditional":"九、冬，十月，壬午，楚師滅陳，執陳公子招，放之於越，殺陳孔奐。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_clt_189_13","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_189","textTraditional":"惡楚子也。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_clt_189_14","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_189","textTraditional":"十、葬陳哀公。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_clt_189_15","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_189","textTraditional":"不與楚滅，閔之也。","sentenceOrder":15}],"overrides":{}}